---
layout: base.njk
pageKey: about
title: About
permalink: about.html
description: Symbio AI is two builders redesigning websites first, then adding booking systems, custom apps, and AI tools when they help a business move revenue.
---

{# ===== Page head ====================================================== #}
<section class="section section--tight">
  <div class="container container--narrow center">
    <span class="eyebrow eyebrow--center">About Symbio AI</span>
    <h1 class="section__title">If you can explain it, we can build it.</h1>
    <p class="section__lead">
      Symbio AI redesigns websites first, then adds booking systems, custom apps, and AI tools
      when they help the business get more calls, bookings, and trust.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

{# ===== Vision ========================================================= #}
<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="grid grid--2 grid--top">
      <div data-reveal>
        <span class="eyebrow">Our vision</span>
        <h2 class="section__title">Most businesses do not need a louder website. They need a clearer one.</h2>
        <p class="text-lead mt-6">
          Visitors show up, but the page does not always make them trust the business or take the
          next step. Sometimes the offer is buried, the mobile page feels dated, or booking takes
          too many steps. We clean that up first, then add smarter systems when they make sense.
        </p>
      </div>

      <ul class="card__list" data-reveal data-reveal-delay="1">
        <li>Plain English in, a better website out.</li>
        <li>A free scan before anyone talks money.</li>
        <li>Honest pricing and realistic timelines.</li>
        <li>We build only what helps the business look better and convert better.</li>
        <li>You always have a direct line to the builders.</li>
        <li>{{ site.poweredBy }}</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{# ===== Founders ====================================================== #}
<section class="section section--tint">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section__head" data-reveal>
      <span class="eyebrow">The team</span>
      <h2 class="section__title">Two founders. Reachable directly.</h2>
      <p class="section__lead">No account managers, no runaround. You work with the people building it.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid--2">
      {% for person in site.founders %}
        <article class="founder" data-reveal data-reveal-delay="{{ loop.index0 }}">
          <span class="founder__avatar" aria-hidden="true">{{ person.name | first }}</span>
          <h3 class="founder__name">{{ person.name }}</h3>
          <p class="founder__role">{{ person.role }}</p>
          <div class="founder__contact">
            <a href="mailto:{{ site.businessEmail }}">Email: {{ site.businessEmail }}</a>
            {% if person.phone %}
              <a href="tel:{{ person.phone | replace(r/[^0-9+]/g, '') }}">Phone: {{ person.phone }}</a>
            {% endif %}
          </div>
        </article>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{# ===== Process ======================================================= #}
<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section__head section__head--center" data-reveal>
      <span class="eyebrow eyebrow--center">The process</span>
      <h2 class="section__title">Scan, map, build, polish</h2>
      <p class="section__lead">A simple path from missed interest to better follow-up and booked customers.</p>
    </div>

    <ol class="grid grid--4">
      <li class="step" data-reveal>
        <span class="step__num">1</span>
        <h3 class="step__title">Scan</h3>
        <p class="step__text">
          We review your site for free and show where trust, mobile flow, or the next step could be clearer.
        </p>
      </li>
      <li class="step" data-reveal data-reveal-delay="1">
        <span class="step__num">2</span>
        <h3 class="step__title">Map</h3>
        <p class="step__text">
          We map the smallest set of changes that move revenue the most, then price it honestly.
        </p>
      </li>
      <li class="step" data-reveal data-reveal-delay="2">
        <span class="step__num">3</span>
        <h3 class="step__title">Build</h3>
        <p class="step__text">
          We redesign the site quickly and clearly, then add booking, app, or AI tools only when needed.
        </p>
      </li>
      <li class="step" data-reveal data-reveal-delay="3">
        <span class="step__num">4</span>
        <h3 class="step__title">Polish</h3>
        <p class="step__text">
          We tune copy, speed, mobile flow, and follow-up until it feels ready.
        </p>
      </li>
    </ol>
  </div>
</section>

{# ===== Closing CTA =================================================== #}
<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="cta-band" data-reveal>
      <h2 class="cta-band__title">Tell us what you want your site to do better</h2>
      <p class="cta-band__text">
        If you can explain what feels broken, slow, outdated, or confusing, we can show you the
        first fix. Start with a free scan or email us directly.
      </p>
      <div class="btn-row btn-row--center">
        <a class="btn btn--light btn--lg" href="{{ site.cta.url }}">{{ site.cta.label }}</a>
        <a class="btn btn--secondary btn--lg" href="mailto:{{ site.businessEmail }}">Email the team</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
